    "show_share": true,
    "description": "The Aga Khan University's Brain and Mind Institute (BMI) has concluded its three-day Global Conference on Brain and Mental Health, held from November 3-5 at AKU's Stadium Road campus in Karachi. Themed \"Building Thriving Communities: Promoting Brain and Mental Health,\" the conference brought together leading researchers, clinicians, policymakers and community leaders from across Pakistan and around the world to discuss urgent priorities for mental health in the Global South.",
